atch"><p class="mut">荐票 · 结论</p><p>不荐票，空仓合法。</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-cycle-713f1a1c5916b20b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">荐票 · 标的</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">荐票 · 标的</p><p>[]</p></div></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-d72da15c6240c66e"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-35808f91fc7add54"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><h3>中性偏防守：宽度尚可但主线确认不足</h3></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-9d8540134c7281f3"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>量能台阶→先行指标三窗→情绪五阶段(五路投票)→连板梯队→攻防总开关,五件事定仓位。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-7249be6b0e744960"></span><span id="claim-cycle-c08f20b03d3f6f26"></span><span id="claim-cycle-ebcc49e8213c7173"></span><span id="claim-cycle-8ea3db4a9e68957d"></span><span id="claim-cycle-d7d848ea7656f939"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-f82fc8584b3762a7"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>两市量能20315.0亿防守台阶未达3.3万亿看多门槛与3.5万亿主升门槛</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-e28cacdb269a8e80"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>情绪阶段(主判)中性偏防守·降C档宽度尚可，主线确认不足，按轮动处理</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-6b2fb59d13bcdfcd"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>市场温度 · 250日分位63.2冰点偏冷中性偏热过热中性</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-3db5ddefa0413385"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>执行仓位上限0至2成空仓合法C档防守，缺失数据不转成安全信号</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-dbfd833bd61b26a8"></span><span id="claim-cycle-0f058cd0a0224090"></span><span id="claim-cycle-81b5227d8f732b01"></span><span id="claim-cycle-ae055f38ee061f3f"></span><span id="claim-cycle-77df3002e3c8eeb4"></span><span id="claim-cycle-53cd78e77f5ec709"></span><span id="claim-cycle-c9dd8d657d1c6ed7"></span><span id="claim-cycle-e0e696ea3a2d16ff"></span><span id="claim-cycle-e8923246b9e5621a"></span><span id="claim-cycle-7c55cddef1152e44"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-02e9b53b069f635d"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><p><b>[实证]</b> 当日成交额20315.0亿，未达3.3万亿看多门槛与3.5万亿主升门槛；按米氏规则仍处防守侧。成交额低于3万亿退潮线的量能约束与温度63.2中性并存，不能把涨停宽度单独升级为趋势行情。</p></div></div></section><section id="leading"><h2>二 先行指标 · 三窗触发器</h2><div id="component-LEADIND"><!--LEADIND--><div class="card"><p style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">情绪先行指标 · 近20日 <span class="mut" style="font-weight:400">(脚本段A档 · 情绪先行指标.py --card · 当日温度 —,阈值冰点&lt;25/过热≥85)</span></p><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683">涨停数_净=103</div><svg viewBox="0 0 880 196" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block"><line x1="46" y1="172" x2="866" y2="172" stroke="#3a3f46"></line><line x1="46" y1="128.4" x2="866" y2="128.4" stroke="#8a6d2f" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="0.8"></line><text x="866" y="125.4" font-size="8.5" fill="#8a6d2f" text-anchor="end">1进2率10%=接力冰点参考线</text><rect x="55.8" y="55.4" width="21.3" height="116.6" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="66.5" y="52" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">79</text><rect x="96.8" y="118.9" width="21.3" height="53.1" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="107.5" y="116" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">36</text><rect x="137.8" y="55.4" width="21.3" height="116.6" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="148.5" y="52" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">79</text><rect x="178.8" y="92.3" width="21.3" height="79.7" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="189.5" y="89" font-size="8" fill="