9-02</text><text x="599.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">09-04</text><text x="681.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">09-08</text><text x="763.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">09-10</text><text x="845.5" y="168" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">09-21</text><text x="46" y="12" font-size="9" fill="#98a0ab">昨停溢价=昨日涨停池今日开盘买→收盘均收(执行口径,%);红正绿负;金点=连负≥3日(洗出反弹窗条件)</text></svg><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #33383f;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#5b636d">❄ 冰点进攻窗 · —</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#5b636d">温度&lt;25</div></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #33383f;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#5b636d">☢ 过热禁追窗 · —</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#5b636d">温度≥85</div></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #33383f;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#5b636d">♨ 洗出反弹窗 · —</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#5b636d">溢价连负3日</div></div></div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683;margin-top:8px">读法:柱线剪刀口张开(涨停创高而金线趴地)=数量繁荣×接力冰点;三窗战绩=2025-07~2026-07单牛市周期回测,小样本,给环境判断不给指令。已证伪:复合&quot;冰点+≥2转机分量&quot;硬条件。</div></div><!--/LEADIND--></div><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-cycle-e959630ebd2317fd"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-verdict">结论</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 结论</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 结论</p><p>中性偏防守：宽度尚可但主线确认不足，按轮动而非趋势行情处理。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-2351bfd054bacd44"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 证据</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 证据</p><p>市场温度63.2，温度档为中性；涨停103、炸板25、封板率80.47%、最高板5。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-10b43c2f0eddd56b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 证据</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 证据</p><p>结构上首板82/103，二板13、三板5、四板2、五板1，宽度明显高于高度。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-8e3f966e9348ecd9"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 证据</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 证据</p><p>题材归位来源档A=0、B=103、C=0，且题材线52条，未形成可核验的公告催化主线。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-504ff3a846a3f4e5"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 证据</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 证据</p><p>风险日历为partial，竞价撤单差分为unavailable；两项缺口不能被解释为无风险或无撤单。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-82c2abbfc6bd9a43"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 档位</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 档位</p><p>C</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-83f7c89b0a7af6ae"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 置信度</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 置信度</p><p>中</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-f7c67f94435e004e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-condition">条件</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 可证伪条件</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 可证伪条件</p><p>若后续交易日出现高度晋级、封板率改善且形成同链跨环节主线，则本次“主线确认不足”的判断被证伪。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-b302ae3c720babf5"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-limitation">限制</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 独立盲区声明</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 独立盲区声明</p><p>未将缺失的风险事件源、9:25动态轨迹和撤单差分补造成证据；周期判断不外推缺失字段。</p></div><span id="claim-cycle-cb5878209e127a47"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-5017f07fa43a9f14"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><p><b>[实证]</b> 一进二率30.3%，二进三率50.0%，高度晋级率46.7%，核按钮率2.1%；昨日涨停溢价：—。</p><p><b>触发器字段原样：</b>[]。当日未读到可用触发器条目，不补写冰点进攻窗、过热禁追窗或洗出反弹窗；缺少触发器不等于安全信号。</p></div></div></section><section id="stages"><h2>三 情绪五阶段 · 五路周期投票</h2><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-cc276c3556c9814e"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-81fd35a9581c0559"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><div class="stages"><div class="stage">冰点</div><div class="stage">启动</div><div class="stage on">中性偏防守</div><div class="stage">高潮</div><div class="stage">退潮</div></div><p>主判=中性偏防守·降，档位C。五路判断背景档位为竞价C/席位B/题材C/逻辑C/涨停C；周期投票台账当日未落盘，tally记全路弃权，n_voted=0，不能称为五路周期共识。</p><p>宽度尚可但主线确认不足，按轮动而非趋势行情处理；封板率80.5%达到80%次日分化阈值，方向保守。</p></div></div></section><section id="ladder"><h2>四 连板梯队</h2><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-93e445ebdf03bccb"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-c8a73fc7b95ae2a2"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><div class="cols"><div class="col"><b>1</b><span>5板</span></div><div class="col"><b>2</b><span>4板</span></div><div class="col"><b>5</b><span>3板</span></div><div class="col"><b>13</b><span>2板</span></div><div class="col hotc"><b>82</b><span>1板</span></div></div><p><b>[实证]</b> 连板梯队为1板82/2板13/3板5/4板2/5板1。首板82占宽度主体，最高5板仅1只，中位数量递减；宽度大于高度，主线确认仍不足。</p></div></div></section><section id="position"><h2>五 攻防 · 仓位总开关</h2><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-89b5d88282073f77"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-6b33bd3a94b00742"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><b>C档防守：空仓合法，执行仓位上限0至2成</b><div class="stages"><div class="stage">主升<small>8至10成</small></div><div class="stage">启动混沌<small>4至5成</small></div><div class="stage on">防守<small>0至2成</small></div></div><div class="posmeter"><i style="width:20%"></i><em style="left:20%"></em></div><div class="posml"><span>0成</span><span>执行上限0至2成</span><span>10成</span></div><p>禁追高、禁接力孤立最高板、禁把B档行业兜底当主线。封板率80.5%达到80%次日分化阈值，不能把这一单项读数改写成进攻确认。</p></div></div></section><section id="research"><h2>六 自主深挖 · 指标与阈值孵化</h2><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-cycle-d3bb914e0ecc97e1"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖</span></div><p class="mut">深挖</p><p>验证下一交易日是否出现同链跨环节扩散，以及五板核心能否带动二板以上梯队。</p></div><span id="claim-cycle-caff3248ffebef2c"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-044fb61ce243d939"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><p>题材归位A=0/B=103/C=0，未形成可核验的公告催化主线；风险日历为partial，竞价撤单差分为unavailable。缺失数据不得写成安全信号，也不把风险日历缺口解释成无风险或把撤单差分缺口解释成无撤单。</p><p>复议条件：后续交易日出现高度晋级、封板率改善并形成同链跨环节主线；在这些事实未同步出现前，维持C档防守。</p></div></div></section><section id="cognition"><h2>七 我的认知迭代 · 最新</h2><div class="tl"><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-d7ba6ed147210ed3"></span></div><div class="tli" id="claim-cycle-cf6d5d85e385f4e7"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代</p><p>中性温度不等于可进攻；将宽度/高度/催化证据分开审查。</p></div><details class="chain tlfold"><summary><b>其余认知与原文证据</b><span class="chip">1条</span></summary><div class="inner"><div class="" id="claim-cycle-50a1b839868b9387"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="tli"><b>09-21</b> 中性温度与宽度扩张不等于趋势启动；本日封板率80.5%达到次日分化阈值，题材归位A=0且五路周期投票n_voted=0，故主线确认不足按轮动处理，C档防守与空仓合法。</div></div></div></details></div></section><details class="chain"><summary>编辑说明与来源审计</summary><div class="inner"><div class="claim-anchor-bank" aria-hidden="true"><pre class="claim-anchor-text">Cycle · 周期与情绪 · 截至 2026-09-21 收盘
